Package: rssn
Type: Package
Title: Scientific Computing with the rssn Engine
Version: 3.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("The rssn developers", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "developers@rssn.invalid")
  )
Description: A computer algebra system, a set of numerical kernels and a
    physics simulation engine behind one small API.  This package binds the
    rssn C ABI: a session owns an expression graph, operators are requests that
    'compute()' reduces, and every one of the engine's registered operators has
    a function here, generated from the engine's own kernel manifest.  Terms
    carry the four renderings the engine produces (infix text, LaTeX, Typst and
    a Unicode drawing), the unit and constant tables travel with the manifest,
    and higher-order operators accept an ordinary R function as a host
    callback.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: RSSN 3.0 C ABI (rssn.dll, librssn.so or
    librssn.dylib), including prerelease builds
LazyData: false
